    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div>
        <a class="logo" href="/" aria-label="풀다 홈">
          <span class="logo-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="dark-logo" aria-hidden="true">PULDA</span>
        </a>
        <p><span class="light-copy">Untying the knot of complexity.</span><span class="dark-copy">Engineering clarity after dark.</span></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3><span class="light-copy">바로가기</span><span class="dark-copy">Navigation</span></h3>
        <nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="푸터 메뉴">
          <a href="/about/"><span class="light-copy">소개</span><span class="dark-copy">About</span></a>
          <a href="/project/"><span class="light-copy">과제</span><span class="dark-copy">Project</span></a>
          <a href="/story/"><span class="light-copy">이야기</span><span class="dark-copy">Story</span></a>
          <a href="/contact/"><span class="light-copy">만남</span><span class="dark-copy">Contact</span></a>
        </nav>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3><span class="light-copy">문의</span><span class="dark-copy">Contact</span></h3>
        <a href="mailto:1p@puldaunion.com">1p@puldaunion.com</a>
        <a href="tel:+82-507-1306-4515">0507-1306-4515</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3><span class="light-copy">위치</span><span class="dark-copy">Base</span></h3>
        <p><span class="light-copy">서울 강남구</span><span class="dark-copy">Seoul, KR</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="copyright">
      <span><span class="light-copy">© 2026 풀다. 모든 권리를 보유합니다.</span><span class="dark-copy">© 2026 PULDA. All systems reserved.</span></span>
      <span><span class="light-copy">전략 · 디자인 · 기술</span><span class="dark-copy">Strategy · Interface · Engineering</span></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
